# Backspace that would turn the middle of an address into a tag is refused, so the text never becomes a tag on reload.
file <<END
- Write to x@home
END
see Write to x@home
keys <Enter> <Left> <Left> <Left> <Left> <Left> <BS>
status Tags are set in Edit Node (e)
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Write to x@home
END
